flowchart TD
  S["Past diagrams / visual code / stories"] --> Q["Discover, dedupe, verify exact source"]
  Q --> R["Rights, privacy, provenance, currentness"]
  R --> G["Typed relational graph + uncertainty"]
  G --> T["CoDoodle / CoTurtle bounded variants"]
  T --> V["CoMap / CoOrb / Glyph / Text / Timeline"]
  V --> E{"Tests, contradiction and visual review"}
  E -->|"PASS scope only"| C["Receipt + versioned candidate"]
  E -->|"FAIL / HELD"| H["Preserve failed prior and missing proof"]
  C --> W["Wake only for significant delta"]
  H --> W
  W -.-> Q
